{"id":"golden-silk","name":{"en":"Golden Silk","ja":"金の絹糸","tc":"金絹線","sc":"金绢线"},"desc1":{"en":"This is gold-dyed silk thread. It's very difficult to dye the thread beautifully.","ja":"「金色に染めた絹の糸だね。綺麗な金色に　染めるのは、実は結構大変なんだよ」","tc":"「這是染成金色的絹線呢。　要染成漂亮的金色其實是很費事的喔。」","sc":"“这是染成金色的绢线呢。　要染成漂亮的金色其实是很费事的哦。”"},"desc2":{"en":"But makes the charm of that much better. It would be nice for embroidery on clothes.","ja":"「でもその分、見栄えはすごく良いわね。　お洋服の刺繍なんかにはぴったりだわ」","tc":"「不過相對地，看起來也十分稱頭，　很適合拿來做洋裝上的刺繡。」","sc":"“不过相对地，看起来也十分得体，　很适合拿来做洋装上的刺绣。”"},"char1":"firis","char2":"liane","level":13,"trait":{"id":"supreme-feel","name":{"en":"Supreme Feel","ja":"最上の手触り","tc":"最棒的觸感","sc":"最棒的触感"}},"categories":[{"id":"animal-mat","name":{"en":"(Animal Mat)","ja":"（動物素材）","tc":"（動物材料）","sc":"（动物材料）"},"icon":"firis-category-animal-mat"},{"id":"fuel","name":{"en":"(Fuel)","ja":"（燃料）","tc":"（燃料）","sc":"（燃料）"},"icon":"ryza2-category-fuel"},{"id":"thread","name":{"en":"(Thread)","ja":"（糸素材）","tc":"（線材）","sc":"（线材）"},"icon":"ryza2-category-threads"}],"locations":[{"id":"claudel-prairie","name":{"en":"Claudel Prairie","ja":"クラーデル平原","tc":"吊鐘杯平原","sc":"吊钟杯平原"}},{"id":"white-fog-forest","name":{"en":"White Fog Forest","ja":"白霧ヶ森","tc":"白霧之森","sc":"白雾之森"}},{"id":"lebenwald","name":{"en":"Lebenwald","ja":"レーベンヴァルト","tc":"生命之森","sc":"生命之森"}},{"id":"silent-labyrinth","name":{"en":"Silent Labyrinth","ja":"深閑のラビュリント","tc":"靜寂的迷宮","sc":"静寂的迷宫"}},{"id":"skyfaring-stone-ark","name":{"en":"Skyfaring Stone Ark","ja":"空渡りの岩舟","tc":"渡空岩舟","sc":"渡空岩舟"}}],"monsters":[{"id":"living-grimoire","name":{"en":"Living Grimoire","ja":"いきてる魔術書","tc":"有生命的魔法書","sc":"有生命的魔法书"}},{"id":"forbidden-codex","name":{"en":"Forbidden Codex","ja":"禁断の写本","tc":"禁斷手抄本","sc":"禁断手抄本"}}],"fixed_components":[{"color":"yellow","name":{"en":"Nice Feel","ja":"いい手触り","tc":"觸感良好","sc":"触感良好"},"value":10}],"random_components":[{"color":"yellow","name":{"en":"Shining","ja":"光っている","tc":"散發光芒","sc":"散发光芒"},"value":10},{"color":"yellow","name":{"en":"Gold Dust